* External connector excitation ONLY. This is not a monitor oscillator.
Vrail p41 0 41
Vg1 ug1 0 -25
Vg2 ug2 0 350
Vg4 ug4 0 175
* Four states per 400 us: VIDEO low/high, then repeat with INTENS high.
Vvideo vid 0 PULSE(0 5 100u 20n 20n 100u 200u)
Vintensity intens 0 PULSE(0 5 200u 20n 20n 200u 400u)
* Small constant beam-current test load and socket/tube capacitance.
Ibeam 0 cathode 20u
Csocket cathode 0 {tube_cathode_c}
